            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='18'>Definitions</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Active: first dmart order month</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='14'>Total number of users who give their first order on related month</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Active: reorder</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='14'>Total number of users who give their first order previous month and related month again </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Inactive: last month active</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='14'>Total number of users who give their first order related month but not next month </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Inactive: more than 1 month</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='14'>Total number of users don’t give order more than 1 month </run>
